{"id":"n72460-1-8","stage":2,"title":"한숨 · 叹气","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72460-1-8-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬니?","zh":"为什么叹气叹得这么厉害啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땅이","meaning":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","explanation":"땅：地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"1","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꺼져라","meaning":"塌下来，塌陷","explanation":"꺼지다：塌下来，塌陷；어라：在 땅이 꺼져라 等固定表达中，以夸张方式描述动作的程度。","readings":[{"term":"꺼지다","audio":"/audio/553c838f462d024d140d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41592","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한숨을","meaning":"叹气","explanation":"한숨：叹气；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72460","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬니?","meaning":"呼吸，喘","explanation":"쉬다：呼吸，喘；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62819","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"地面（땅이 꺼져라 한숨을 쉬다：夸张地说深深叹气）","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"553c838f462d024d","term":"꺼지다","zh":"塌下来，塌陷","audio":"/audio/553c838f462d024d140d.mp3","entryId":"41592","definition":"地面等往下陷。","pronunciation":["꺼지다"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"叹气","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"72460","definition":"在忧愁或放松紧张的时候，呼出长气。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"呼吸，喘","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"62819","definition":"用鼻子或嘴吸入空气后再呼出。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f23ce1c280641360120.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72460-1-8-2","ko":"요즘 걱정거리가 많아서 말이야.","zh":"最近有太多烦心事了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정거리가","meaning":"愁事，心事","explanation":"걱정거리：愁事，心事；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걱정거리","audio":"/audio/37eabcf9b0471073be34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21608","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아서","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"37eabcf9b0471073","term":"걱정거리","zh":"愁事，心事","audio":"/audio/37eabcf9b0471073be34.mp3","entryId":"21608","definition":"让人担心的事情。","pronunciation":["걱쩡꺼리"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e788d485bcc1d411fc0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72460","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4535,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近有太多烦心事了。","您想找什么条件的房子？","为什么叹气叹得这么厉害啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近有太多烦心事了。","为什么叹气叹得这么厉害啊？","您想找什么条件的房子？"],"answer":0}]}
